## Structure

```
.specweave/
├── increments/####-name/     # metadata.json, spec.md, plan.md, tasks.md
├── docs/internal/specs/      # Living docs
└── config.json
```

**⛔ Increment root**: ONLY `metadata.json`, `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`

**Everything else → subfolders**: `reports/` | `logs/` | `scripts/` | `backups/`
